WEBVTT

00:02.369 --> 00:03.836
Legend has it...

00:05.005 --> 00:07.803
...that during the Heian Period, there
were men who fought with no weapons.

00:08.142 --> 00:13.478
They were known as the Men of
Carnage and they reigned undefeated.

00:14.949 --> 00:20.114
Their technique was called
the Mutsu Enmei Style.

00:33.234 --> 00:40.663
<i>The Age of Chaos</i>
<i>Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

00:40.941 --> 00:46.777
<i>Rushing through my innocent</i>
<i>youth without a care in the world.</i>

00:48.315 --> 00:54.220
<i>This soul of mine is</i>
<i>so easy to influence.</i>

00:55.890 --> 00:59.656
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

00:59.760 --> 01:02.957
<i>WORRY ABOUT IDENTITY</i>

01:06.734 --> 01:13.799
<i>This is what I'm wishing</i>
<i>for as I sing this song.</i>

01:13.974 --> 01:19.810
<i>I want you to acknowledge</i>
<i>me, that's all.</i>

01:20.681 --> 01:27.951
<i>You smiled at me for</i>
<i>the very first time.</i>

01:28.122 --> 01:36.530
<i>Thank you so much, thank you</i>
<i>from the bottom of my heart.</i>

01:37.231 --> 01:38.892
<i>I'll never forget it.</i>

01:48.642 --> 01:52.078
<i>The Age of Chaos</i>
<i>Mutsu Enmei Style Gaiden</i>

01:54.014 --> 02:01.443
<i>The Shogun's Tournament</i>

02:09.563 --> 02:14.466
The Shogun is here!

02:38.092 --> 02:39.457
So, he's finally here.

02:43.664 --> 02:45.097
You may raise your heads.

02:49.503 --> 02:51.903
So that's Iemitsu.

02:52.773 --> 02:55.936
Make no mistake, I'll have his head!

03:05.819 --> 03:09.550
In place of my father Munenori,
I, Samon Tomonori Yagyu...

03:09.690 --> 03:13.626
...shall have the honor of presiding
over the Shogun's Tournament today.

03:13.927 --> 03:18.421
Ah, Samon! I had been looking
forward to seeing you win today...

03:18.766 --> 03:22.224
...but since your brother Jubei is
competing, I suppose it can't be helped.

03:22.369 --> 03:24.428
I'm counting on you to referee.

03:24.571 --> 03:25.435
Yes, my lord.

03:26.874 --> 03:30.401
Now then, allow me to explain
the rules of today's matches.

03:31.812 --> 03:36.078
First, you will all compete
in predetermined match-ups.

03:36.517 --> 03:41.284
The winners of this round shall
advance to the elimination tournament.

03:42.856 --> 03:46.883
May all your daily training
come to fruition today!

03:48.162 --> 03:50.096
Who's your opponent?

03:50.230 --> 03:52.596
The Battou Tamiya Style,
something like that.

03:52.966 --> 03:54.934
That's him over there.

03:55.336 --> 03:58.669
Hmm, sword-drawing, huh?
He'll be hard to beat.

04:00.407 --> 04:01.533
What about you?

04:01.642 --> 04:04.805
You're up against the guy
next to him, Shigetaka Togo.

04:04.912 --> 04:06.504
How are you planning to fight him?

04:06.613 --> 04:07.602
Beats me!

04:08.649 --> 04:09.741
Your Highness...

04:16.223 --> 04:17.155
Let's begin!

04:18.559 --> 04:22.518
To the East, of the Ono-ha
Itto-Style, Lord Tadatsune Ono.

04:25.666 --> 04:29.193
Who would have thought the
master himself would be competing...

04:29.336 --> 04:31.497
Let's see how good you are!

04:31.905 --> 04:35.864
To the West, of the Maniwa-nen-Style,
Lord Sadakatsu Higuchi.

04:37.244 --> 04:40.179
The Style of the Shogun's
swordsmanship instructor versus...

04:40.547 --> 04:47.612
...the Maniwa-nen Style. It forbids the
use of the sword in a samurai's service.

04:48.188 --> 04:49.155
Begin!

05:05.339 --> 05:07.864
So this is the Maniwa-nen
Style clinging technique?

05:08.008 --> 05:08.906
In that case...

05:17.017 --> 05:18.006
Stop!

05:18.185 --> 05:20.779
Winner, Lord Tadatsune!

05:23.524 --> 05:27.893
To the east, of the Yagyu Shinkage
Style, Lord Hyogonosuke Yagyu.

05:28.228 --> 05:31.959
To the west, of the Shinmen
Style, Lord Jinnai Kousaka.

05:34.802 --> 05:38.294
So it's come to this, even a
lowly Suppa bandit dares to...

05:38.405 --> 05:40.839
...compete in the Shogun's Tournament!

05:41.175 --> 05:43.075
Who is this Jinnai Kousaka?

05:43.410 --> 05:47.369
He belongs to a clan of Koushu
ninjas, of the Suppa class.

05:47.514 --> 05:51.678
I hear that in imitation of
Musashi, he uses two sais...

05:51.852 --> 05:53.319
Uses two sais...

05:53.520 --> 05:54.487
Begin!

06:03.597 --> 06:06.657
Why don't you show me how
good the Owari Yagyu is!

06:07.501 --> 06:12.131
Playing the eccentric warrior? Such
child's play is beneath me!

06:20.247 --> 06:24.581
I should've expected this from a leader
of the esteemed Owari Yagyu Clan!

06:28.322 --> 06:29.914
The Shinmen Style, huh?

06:35.062 --> 06:35.926
Wow...

06:36.029 --> 06:37.997
Still, he's nowhere near Yagyu's level...

06:44.004 --> 06:45.062
Stop!

06:45.172 --> 06:47.299
Winner, Lord Hyogonosuke Yagyu!

06:47.541 --> 06:52.103
True to the Yagyu name, the Edo and
Owari branches are both powerful!

06:53.146 --> 06:54.044
Next match!

06:54.147 --> 06:57.878
To the east, of the Araki Style,
Lord Mataemon Araki!

06:59.052 --> 07:03.079
To the west, of the Niten Ichi
Style, Lord Iori Miyamoto!

07:03.423 --> 07:05.391
So that's Iori Miyamoto!

07:05.993 --> 07:09.588
The man who inherited Musashi's two-
sword technique... I can hardly wait!

07:13.667 --> 07:14.691
Begin!

07:34.888 --> 07:36.515
Why aren't they moving?

07:36.623 --> 07:39.183
They are sizing up one another, my lord.

07:39.626 --> 07:42.618
If I may be so bold,
Mataemon's Araki Style is an...

07:42.696 --> 07:45.221
...offshoot of my own Edo Yagyu Style.

07:45.499 --> 07:47.933
He practices tirelessly, and excels at...

07:48.035 --> 07:50.128
...attacking after gauging
his opponent's ability.

07:50.671 --> 07:53.162
His opponent, Iori
Miyamoto, is a master of...

07:53.273 --> 07:56.174
...Lord Musashi's Issun
no Mikiri technique.

07:56.310 --> 08:00.838
Because of these skills, what we're
seeing now is a battle in the mind.

08:01.048 --> 08:03.414
Battle in the mind, you say?

08:13.460 --> 08:15.451
So escape is Musashi's art of war?

08:21.702 --> 08:22.726
Well?

08:23.270 --> 08:25.397
Y-You win.

08:25.606 --> 08:28.507
Stop! Winner, Lord Iori Miyamoto!

08:28.742 --> 08:31.336
Well! That was
impressive, Iori Miyamoto.

08:31.545 --> 08:35.140
I suppose that was Musashi's Niten
Ichi Style Issun no Mikiri technique!

08:35.248 --> 08:36.146
Yes, indeed.

08:36.850 --> 08:38.477
Certainly, he is powerful.

08:38.585 --> 08:42.112
No wonder Musashi sent him to
the tournament in his place...

08:42.723 --> 08:45.453
Jubei, can you beat him?

08:46.026 --> 08:49.427
But I want to know why he
didn't use both swords.

08:49.863 --> 08:53.993
If I may, my lord, Musashi's
two swords are just a gimmick.

08:54.134 --> 08:57.934
I believe it's no more than
a ploy to draw attention...

08:58.105 --> 09:02.872
It is not actually a technique wherein
two swords are used at the same time.

09:03.910 --> 09:04.740
Next match!

09:04.845 --> 09:09.578
To the east, of the Battou Tamiya
Style, Lord Nagakatsu Tamiya!

09:10.283 --> 09:15.243
To the west, of the Mutsu Enmei
Style, Lady Tsubura Mutsu!

09:15.722 --> 09:17.656
Oh, is that the one, Izu?

09:17.758 --> 09:19.316
The legendary Mutsu fighter?

09:19.426 --> 09:20.222
Yes, my lord.

09:20.360 --> 09:22.624
But she's actually a woman.

09:22.763 --> 09:25.960
Can she really be so powerful?
And unarmed, as well!

09:26.400 --> 09:29.426
Well, I'm sure you shall
see once the match begins.

09:30.003 --> 09:33.734
Really, look how long the
hilt is on Tamiya's sword!

09:34.207 --> 09:37.870
In the Battou Tamiya Style...

09:37.978 --> 09:40.913
...the rule is to have an 8-inch
hilt and a 30-inch blade.

09:41.014 --> 09:43.209
A long hilt is their strategy...

09:43.483 --> 09:45.451
So that's not a real blade he's using?

09:45.752 --> 09:48.915
It is a blade that has
been dulled, my lord.

09:49.289 --> 09:52.884
In the art of sword-drawing,
a hilt is necessary.

09:53.927 --> 09:55.360
Oh, yes, I see!

09:56.296 --> 10:00.665
"A mere girl! And an unarmed girl at
that! How dare you insult my Style!"

10:00.767 --> 10:03.167
That's not the sort of nonsense I'm
going to say to you. However...

10:03.303 --> 10:04.327
However?

10:04.838 --> 10:08.035
The Battou Tamiya technique
is executed with a dull blade.

10:08.208 --> 10:11.143
Even so, there is still
the potential for death.

10:12.245 --> 10:14.270
Consider yourself warned.

10:14.614 --> 10:17.777
If you miss your target, a real sword
is no different than a bamboo sword!

10:21.955 --> 10:22.979
Begin!

11:00.961 --> 11:03.156
What, did he draw?

11:03.430 --> 11:06.297
I heard the sound of his sword-guard...

11:08.268 --> 11:09.462
Surely not!

11:10.971 --> 11:12.336
She's been cut!

11:22.616 --> 11:23.878
Surely not...

11:24.651 --> 11:28.485
She couldn't have been
cut, not in so short a time...

11:34.294 --> 11:35.852
Swing and a miss!

11:36.730 --> 11:39.426
Hmm, so she dodged that blow.

11:40.433 --> 11:43.266
Young Miss, you must stay on your
toes.

11:44.237 --> 11:46.467
There's no doubt about Tamiya's
prowess.

11:46.907 --> 11:50.035
Most swordsmen wouldn't stand
a chance against him, but...

12:04.891 --> 12:07.792
How dare she attack
me unarmed, is she mad?

12:22.576 --> 12:23.508
Stop!

12:23.643 --> 12:25.736
Winner, Lady Tsubura Mutsu!

12:26.179 --> 12:27.703
Ah! Splendid!

12:28.882 --> 12:31.680
So the Mutsu legend is true, after all.

12:32.118 --> 12:36.054
To think that for a mere 1,000 ryo,
the Mutsu skills are on my side!

12:36.156 --> 12:38.283
What a small price to pay!

12:38.391 --> 12:39.289
She can do it!

12:39.392 --> 12:43.522
This woman will surely bring the
arrogant Yagyu Clan to its knees!

12:44.764 --> 12:47.699
It was an unfortunate
match-up for Lord Tamiya.

12:48.468 --> 12:50.902
Because of that long
hilt, the Young Miss was...

12:51.004 --> 12:53.666
...able to check him
from afar with a kick.

12:54.274 --> 12:56.742
Mutsu Enmei Style, eh?

12:57.611 --> 13:02.173
Because of Tamiya's skill, the Mutsu
technique was all the more impressive.

13:02.582 --> 13:05.210
Izu, you are to be
commended for finding her.

13:05.518 --> 13:07.486
I am unworthy of your praise!

13:09.456 --> 13:10.650
Well, Tajima?

13:10.757 --> 13:13.954
Will Jubei be able to
top what I just saw now?

13:14.160 --> 13:15.127
Yes, my lord.

13:15.562 --> 13:17.029
Jubei...

13:17.130 --> 13:17.994
Next match!

13:18.098 --> 13:22.432
To the east, of the Yagyu Shinkage
Style, Lord Jubei Yagyu!

13:23.470 --> 13:27.634
To the west, of the Shinto
Style, Lord Yozaemon Ozaki!

13:27.908 --> 13:32.106
That style was founded by the great
Bokuden Tsukara, the Shinto Style.

13:32.445 --> 13:33.377
Begin!

14:09.115 --> 14:10.582
It's over, Samon.

14:11.518 --> 14:12.883
Oh, stop!

14:14.321 --> 14:16.653
Winner, Lord Jubei Yagyu.

14:19.659 --> 14:21.593
That man is one cold snake.

14:22.629 --> 14:24.494
What was that?

14:25.065 --> 14:30.025
Tajima! I was expecting to
see a more spirited duel...

14:30.170 --> 14:31.034
Yes, my lord.

14:31.338 --> 14:34.865
The Yagyu sword is "The
Sword That Gives Life."

14:35.108 --> 14:39.010
It is not a sword for
causing unnecessary bloodshed.

14:39.312 --> 14:42.770
Perhaps it's not showy, but
that is part of our philosophy...

14:43.083 --> 14:45.210
Hmm, perhaps you have a point...

14:46.953 --> 14:50.218
Your tongue is as glib as
ever, Father, if nothing else!

14:50.390 --> 14:54.190
Would it kill you to say that I just
ended it quickly because I was bored?

14:54.694 --> 14:58.562
To the east, of the Toda Style,
Lord Shigeyasu Toda!

14:58.865 --> 15:02.460
To the west, of the Hagai
Style, Lord Heima Hagai!

15:05.772 --> 15:08.240
That is the Toda Style's rightful heir.

15:08.775 --> 15:12.211
Toda is the official sword
instructor of the Kaga Domain.

15:16.983 --> 15:18.109
Begin!

15:41.041 --> 15:42.565
So he's fending me off?

15:50.617 --> 15:51.606
Exquisite!

15:51.885 --> 15:54.012
Winner, Lord Shigeyasu Toda!

15:54.154 --> 15:55.485
Ah!

15:55.955 --> 15:56.944
Huh!

15:57.624 --> 16:01.424
To the east, of the Jigen Style,
Lord Shigetaka Togo.

16:05.131 --> 16:07.395
What in the world is that?

16:08.334 --> 16:11.701
It's not a bokuto. It's
nothing but a wooden stick.

16:11.838 --> 16:14.238
Bokutos are not used in the Jigen Style.

16:14.741 --> 16:19.701
Apparently, they use rods made of oak
to repeatedly strike standing timber...

16:20.146 --> 16:22.273
To the west, Lord Takato!

16:22.715 --> 16:24.080
You're being summoned.

16:28.254 --> 16:31.815
So that's the man said to
have defeated Matabei Takada.

16:32.058 --> 16:33.150
Yes, my lord.

16:33.493 --> 16:38.624
The martial artist in question is the man
recommended by my son Jubei...

16:45.505 --> 16:46.972
A bit too long, huh?

16:54.214 --> 16:55.647
I think that's about right.

16:59.085 --> 17:00.313
He'll win!

17:01.254 --> 17:03.347
He lopped off the tip of his bokuto...

17:03.456 --> 17:05.185
That in itself is amazing...

17:05.291 --> 17:08.055
Is this guy a master
of the kodachi, then?

17:08.628 --> 17:09.925
A kodachi, eh?

17:10.063 --> 17:11.860
In that case, we'll see how he
compares...

17:11.965 --> 17:14.195
...to Shigeyasu, the
peerless kodachi expert...

17:15.034 --> 17:17.298
Do you know who that man is?

17:17.537 --> 17:18.834
No, I don't.

17:23.843 --> 17:24.502
Hey!

17:25.011 --> 17:26.171
I'm off.

17:27.647 --> 17:29.945
That kodachi...

17:30.450 --> 17:32.418
I know I've seen it before somewhere...

17:37.524 --> 17:38.354
Begin!

17:45.131 --> 17:48.294
Well! Togo's stance is
quite unusual, isn't it?

17:49.068 --> 17:50.831
That is the Jigen Style stance.

17:51.571 --> 17:53.835
It is known as the Dragonfly.

18:05.885 --> 18:09.548
Granted, he is an old man now, but
he's still Shigetaka Togo of the...

18:10.323 --> 18:12.348
...Single Strike Deathblow.

18:12.458 --> 18:17.555
How will you take on the master of the
Satsuma Domain's secret technique?

18:18.231 --> 18:20.096
Just show me...

18:42.055 --> 18:45.821
You think you can block my
deathblow with that little kodachi?

18:54.601 --> 18:56.865
Did he just cut him with that stick?

19:03.810 --> 19:06.301
So he blocked it, eh?

19:08.548 --> 19:11.608
Guess I shouldn't have
bothered to chop this thing up.

19:17.857 --> 19:19.950
I concede this match.

19:20.059 --> 19:22.550
B-But why, Lord Togo?

19:24.097 --> 19:25.758
He blocked my first blow.

19:25.898 --> 19:28.526
Not that I don't have
others in my arsenal...

19:28.935 --> 19:33.929
...I put everything I had
into that first blow.

19:34.574 --> 19:39.477
Even if I'm an old man now, if
someone can dodge my best shot...

19:39.746 --> 19:41.907
...then that means I've lost.

19:50.456 --> 19:52.981
Truly, that was magnificent to behold.

19:53.326 --> 19:58.025
Shigetaka Togo of the Jigen Style, you
have made a lasting impression on me!

19:59.832 --> 20:03.893
And you are to be commended for
blocking such an overpowering attack.

20:04.170 --> 20:05.296
Takato, was it?

20:05.405 --> 20:07.396
Your skills are just as impressive!

20:08.708 --> 20:10.767
Winner, Lord Takato!

20:10.877 --> 20:13.710
He's certainly lived up to Jubei's
recommendation, hasn't he, Tajima?

20:13.846 --> 20:14.369
Yes, my lord!

20:15.648 --> 20:16.945
Jubei...

20:17.083 --> 20:21.452
I hope you haven't set yourself
up for your own downfall...

20:23.122 --> 20:26.717
Jubei's whim may be his undoing!

20:27.060 --> 20:31.588
Your Highness, we have finished all
of the matches in the first round.

20:31.731 --> 20:34.928
Right. Everyone
acquitted themselves well.

20:35.635 --> 20:37.933
A fine test of skills!

20:39.272 --> 20:42.139
The Shogun has just honored
you with words of praise.

20:42.508 --> 20:45.568
I will now call out the names of
those advancing to the second round.

20:46.446 --> 20:49.472
Of the Ono-ha Itto Style,
Lord Tadatsune Ono!

20:49.849 --> 20:53.615
Of the Yagyu Shinkage Style,
Lord Hyogonosuke Yagyu!

20:54.053 --> 20:57.580
Of the Niten Ichi Style,
Lord Iori Miyamoto!

20:58.057 --> 21:01.493
Of the Mutsu Enmei Style,
Lady Tsubura Mutsu!

21:01.994 --> 21:05.486
Of the Yagyu Shinkage Style,
Lord Jubei Yagyu!

21:06.165 --> 21:09.157
Of the Toda Style, Lord Shigeyasu Toda!

21:09.535 --> 21:11.696
Finally, Lord Takato!

21:13.206 --> 21:14.400
The second round...

21:14.707 --> 21:16.776
...shall be
contested among these seven!

21:16.776 --> 21:21.110
<i>To be continued...</i>

21:32.258 --> 21:44.295
<i>Those summer stars, I looked up at</i>
<i>them alone when I was a troubled child.</i>

21:44.570 --> 21:54.309
<i>My loneliness and the vast night</i>
<i>sky, melting and shining in eternity.</i>

21:54.447 --> 22:03.446
<i>I just don't know what this</i>
<i>dream means, if it leads to love...</i>

22:03.589 --> 22:14.261
<i>Even if it's just "hello,"</i>
<i>I want to hear your voice.</i>

22:15.301 --> 22:21.433
<i>The person I am today</i>
<i>is about to disappear...</i>

22:21.808 --> 22:24.800
<i>What is it that will hold me back?</i>

22:25.611 --> 22:31.948
<i>Will it be you? I won't ask you now.</i>

22:32.251 --> 22:37.746
<i>Maybe if we ever meet again...</i>

22:52.605 --> 22:55.369
Tsubura has awakened
Jubei's fighting spirit.

22:55.475 --> 22:59.639
With her back against the wall, can
she still go after the Shogun's head?

23:00.680 --> 23:02.580
Next episode of the Age of Chaos...

23:02.748 --> 23:04.147
<i>The Successor</i>

23:04.250 --> 23:06.309
Pay close attention, and wait!
